---
description: Prepare a research view with candidate explanations, search coverage, historical geography and unresolved links.
args: { dossier: LinkageDossier; change: LinkageChange; network: HistoricalNetwork; impacts: LinkEdgeImpact[] }
returns: HistoricalLinkageEdition
---
Show each identity finding with supporting and incompatible sources, date intervals, time-specific place candidates and search scope. Label same, different, related and uncertain distinctly. Include unresolved edges and split impact. Do not render an uncertain network as a settled family tree or historical identity claim.
